# Runtime debug artifacts
debug/*.txt
debug/*.pid
debug/*.json
debug/*.db
debug/*.trigger
debug/*.tmp
# Per-strategy run logs. The patterns above are single-level, so they never
# reached this subtree — it had quietly grown to 7.5 MB across 55 files. These are
# machine-local run output (fills, P&L, spot prints), regenerated on every run.
debug/logs/
debug/**/*.log
debug/**/*.log.bak
# Intraday bar snapshots published by the strategy poller for the terminal's
# chart. Same single-level blind spot as above: debug/*.json never matched this
# subtree, so they were committed and then churned on every poll.
debug/intraday_bars/

